{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.92,
   "text": " Boom, I just asked Datto Joey up how to scale my AI business to 2 million ringgit a year"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.92,
   "end": 8.12,
   "text": " and it's my second year at Thrive with Karina's group."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.52,
   "end": 12.64,
   "text": " And after networking at the achievement club launch, I had one serious question for him."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.02,
   "end": 14.46,
   "text": " So I got onto the mic and asked."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.96,
   "end": 20.4,
   "text": " Datto, we grew our club Malaysia community from 0 to 5000 members in just 193 days"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.4,
   "end": 22.98,
   "text": " and competitors are starting to copy us."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.7,
   "end": 25.68,
   "text": " To hit 2 million ringgit, should we,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.68,
   "end": 29.78,
   "text": " number one, focus on online courses, number two, build a sales team,"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.26,
   "end": 34.46,
   "text": " number three, collaborate, or number four, grow my personal brand."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.26,
   "end": 39.68,
   "text": " So he pulled up my Chairman chart and he said I'm in the live door,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.84,
   "end": 41.74,
   "text": " which is in a super strong position."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.22,
   "end": 46.12,
   "text": " The competitors, they're stuck in the deaf door so it won't last long."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.62,
   "end": 50.84,
   "text": " But to really hit that 2 million ringgit, he said we needed a separate product"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.84,
   "end": 53.94,
   "text": " that sets us completely apart from the rest."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.94,
   "end": 58.16,
   "text": " And out of all of my options, he pointed straight to online courses."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.76,
   "end": 60.1,
   "text": " And it makes so much sense, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.52,
   "end": 63.92,
   "text": " After running over 13 physical workshops in KL,"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.4,
   "end": 68.74,
   "text": " it's time to transition and build a proper online cost ecosystem."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.24,
   "end": 73.28,
   "text": " Now that the mass market demand is validated, it's time to build our mode."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.7,
   "end": 78.12,
   "text": " Oh, and fun fact, this entire video was actually edited by Claude."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.36,
   "end": 81.5,
   "text": " So can we actually hit 2 million ringgit in 2027?"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.5,
   "end": 83.88,
   "text": " Comment, Claude, to follow my journey."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.18,
   "end": 85.56,
   "text": " Follow for day 194."
  }
 ],
